@startuml NekoCafe_Sequence_AIOrder
actor "顾客" as Customer
participant "Mobile UI" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "AI Recommend Service" as AISvc
participant "Cat Profile Service" as CatSvc
database "Order DB" as DB

Customer -> UI : 发起浏览菜单请求(tableId)
UI -> Gateway : GET /api/v1/menu?tableId=xxx
Gateway -> OrderSvc : fetchMenu()
OrderSvc -> AISvc : getRecommendation(userId, tableId)
activate AISvc

AISvc -> CatSvc : getCatsByTable(tableId)
activate CatSvc
CatSvc --> AISvc : 返回猫咪性格与档案数据
deactivate CatSvc

AISvc -> AISvc : 运行协同过滤与匹配算法
AISvc --> OrderSvc : 返回AI推荐菜品列表
deactivate AISvc

OrderSvc --> Gateway : 返回完整菜单(含推荐标签)
Gateway --> UI : 渲染个性化菜单
UI --> Customer : 展示推荐菜品

Customer -> UI : 选择菜品并提交订单
UI -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/orders
Gateway -> OrderSvc : createOrder(payload)
activate OrderSvc
OrderSvc -> DB : 插入订单数据
DB --> OrderSvc : 返回成功
OrderSvc --> Gateway : 返回 orderId
deactivate OrderSvc
Gateway --> UI : 跳转支付页面
@enduml